.
Driver Sickness:
Aspect Needed: "Current Warehouse" of idle drivers
.
Logic: Trigger the Resource Management module to find an available driver at the same physical warehouse location. Prioritize "Home-Base" drivers to minimize repositioning costs
.
Police Checkpoints / Traffic Congestion:
Aspect Needed: "Location Snapshot" freshness
.
Logic: If the actual_gate_in_at time is missed, the agent re-invokes get_feasible_slots using the routing service to provide options that account for the real-time traffic delay verified by GPS
.
Natural Calamities / Long-term Halts:
Aspect Needed: "Facility Capacity Change" event
.
Logic: When a facility is blocked, the TMS Orchestrator must mass-update all TRUCK_EXPECTED shipments to ON_HOLD or DELAYED, preventing the agent from making promises for a closed warehouse


